==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]], the Killer Axe Cat Base had no gaps in its attack range, attacked once every 9.9 seconds and dealt 600 damage.
**Despite the fact that all versions of the game received the stat changes for the Killer Axe Cat Base, only the Japanese version had the altered Killer Axe Cat Base attack animation until [[Version 14.7 Update|Version 14.7]].
*The Killer Axe Cat Base is the only [[:Category:Killer Cats|Killer Cat]] enemy to not be obtainable as a [[Cat Units|Cat Unit]].

